== TRELLIS.2 engine (image tag: trellis2) ==

The image contains, unmodified:
- the `trellis2` package and `o-voxel` from https://github.com/microsoft/TRELLIS.2
  (commit 75fbf0183001ed9876c8dbb35de6b68552ee08bd), MIT License, Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation;
- CuMesh (https://github.com/JeffreyXiang/CuMesh) and FlexGEMM
  (https://github.com/JeffreyXiang/FlexGEMM), MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025 Jianfeng Xiang,
  with their bundled cubvh and xatlas (MIT) and Eigen (MPL 2.0).

It downloads, on first start:
- microsoft/TRELLIS.2-4B and microsoft/TRELLIS-image-large weights (MIT);
- Meta's DINOv3 ViT-L/16 image encoder, from Comfy-Org's ungated copy
  (https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/TRELLIS.2, clip_vision/dino_v3_vit_l.safetensors) unless a
  local copy is supplied. Its weights remain under Meta's DINOv3 License
  (https://ai.meta.com/resources/models-and-libraries/dinov3-license).
  img2mesh/dinov3-vitl16-config.json was generated with transformers' DINOv3ViTConfig.

Not included and not used: briaai/RMBG-2.0 (TRELLIS.2's default background remover,
licensed CC BY-NC 4.0) and NVIDIA nvdiffrast (non-commercial licence); a stub stands
in for the latter's import (docker/stubs). Background removal uses rembg's u2net (Apache 2.0).
